@startuml
title Detailed Sequence Diagram: UC-09 Document Library Management
autonumber
skinparam maxMessageSize 150

actor "Manager" as Mgr
participant "WebDashboard\n<<React>>" as Web
participant "DocumentController\n<<Node.js API>>" as API
participant "S3Storage\n<<Cloud>>" as S3
database "MySQL\n<<Database>>" as DB

Mgr -> Web: Select Project & Upload Document (PDF/DWG)
activate Web
Mgr -> Web: Click "Upload File"

Web -> API: POST /api/documents/upload (file_stream)
activate API

API -> S3: PUT /bucket/projects/{projectID}/ (file_stream)
activate S3
S3 --> API: return fileURL
deactivate S3

API -> DB: INSERT INTO Documents (ProjectID, FileName, FileURL, UploadDate)
activate DB
DB --> API: return docID
deactivate DB

API --> Web: HTTP 201 Created (docMetadataJSON)
deactivate API

Web --> Mgr: Update Document Library Grid View
deactivate Web

@enduml